cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Malnutrition Case Forecasting - Holt-Winters Time Series Analysis"
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hidayatullah
    given-names: Taufan Eka
    affiliation: "University of Darussalam Gontor"
year: 2023
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Forecasting monthly malnutrition cases at an East Java hospital using the
  Holt-Winters triple exponential smoothing family, with SES/DES/TES
  comparison, walk-forward backtesting and out-of-sample validation against
  the 2021 actuals. Reproduces and extends an undergraduate thesis
  ("The Holt-Winters Method for Forecasting Malnutrition Cases in
  Hospitals: A Time Series Analysis Approach", 2023).
keywords:
  - time series forecasting
  - Holt-Winters
  - exponential smoothing
  - SARIMA
  - malnutrition
  - healthcare analytics
